ion)\">Madness</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Hostile</a> to everyone in the vicinity.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202710\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2609/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33487/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7646/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.037/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1346628/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.998      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   66.998      1 -total\n 49.96%   33.475      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 28.33%   18.980      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 15.67%   10.496      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 14.88%    9.970      7 Template:Icon_text\n 14.78%    9.904      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 14.76%    9.890     31 Template:Trim\n 13.15%    8.809      6 Template:Icon_link\n 11.93%    7.994      1 Template:Item_icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:23749-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202710 and revision id 378816. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}